  "solution": "**Logic : (1st number + 2nd number)² + 2 = 3rd number**\n\nGiven:\n\n(i) (4, 5, 83)\n\n⇒ (4 + 5)² + 2 = 83\n\n⇒ (9)² + 2 = 83\n\n⇒ 81 + 2 = 83\n\n⇒ 83 = 83 (LHS = RHS)\n\n(ii) (5, 5, 102)\n\n⇒ (5 + 5)² + 2 = 102\n\n⇒ (10)² + 2 = 102\n\n⇒ 100 + 2 = 102\n\n⇒102 = 102 (LHS = RHS)\n\n**Option (1) :**\n\n​(8, 9, 330)\n\n⇒ (8 + 9)² + 2 = 330\n\n⇒ 289 + 2 = 330\n\n⇒ 291 ≠ 330 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n**Option (2) :**\n\n(3, 3, 11)\n\n⇒ (3 + 3)² + 2 = 11\n\n⇒ (6)² + 2 = 11\n\n⇒ 36 + 2 = 11\n\n⇒ 38 ≠ 11 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n**Option (3) : **\n\n(7, 6, 170)\n\n⇒ (7 + 6)² + 2 = 170\n\n⇒ (13)² + 2 = 170\n\n⇒ 169 + 2 = 170\n\n⇒ 171 ≠ 170 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n**Option(4) :**\n\n​(8, 3, 123)\n\n⇒ (8 + 3)² + 2 = 123\n\n⇒11² + 2 = 123\n\n⇒ 121 + 2 = 123\n\n⇒ 123 = 123 (LHS = RHS)\n\n**Hence, \"Option (4)\" is the correct answer.**\n\n78",
